  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 207.02 Docket Numbers. A docket number shall be assigned to each matter to be heard which shall appear on the notice of hearing and all subsequent orders or decisions of the agency.\n\nSource. #7382, eff 10-25-00, EXPIRED: 10-25-08\n\nNew. #9332, INTERIM, eff 11-27-08, EXPIRED: 5-26-09\n\nNew. #9636-A, eff 1-12-10",
